  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 211.04 Burden of Proof. The municipality shall have the burden to prove the DRA erred in calculating the equalized valuation.\n\nSource. #7153, eff 12-10-99; ss by #8987-A, eff 9-24-07; ss by #9538, eff 9-8-09; ss by #10625-B, eff 6-26-14; ss by #13711-B, eff 8-2-23",
